  "description": "Expression tree JSON serializer for Newtonsoft.Json. Thread-safe fork of aquilae/expression-json-serializer, whose shared mutable caches are unsafe under concurrent use. Adds .NET 10/8/4.8/Standard 2.0 multi-targeting and statement-expression support: block, loop, goto/label, switch and try.",
  "id": "DotNetWorkQueue.Aq.ExpressionJsonSerializer",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-07-30T16:52:08.593Z",
